<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.sovereign.tears ~ a clean tear, preview by default

`lares sense teardown [<group…>]` names every target of the named sensorium groups (none named: every group) and the live holders that block it, touching no disk; `--confirm` removes them. A blocking holder refuses unless `--drain` quiesces it first or `--force` tears anyway. Blocking stays scoped to the selection, and the guest `~/.mempalace` stands untouched.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ preview · tear

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`preview` params=`~ name every target`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`tear` params=`groups/memory confirm/true drain/true ~ drain and tear the memory group`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ groups · confirm · drain · force

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`groups` params=`takes/names seat/1 as/<group…> ~ the sensorium groups; none names every group`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`confirm` params=`~ remove instead of previewing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`drain` params=`~ quiesce the blocking holders first`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`force` params=`~ tear even where a holder blocks`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ removes this host's sensorium trees; a person at a real terminal, and the verb names its intent with --approve where it asks one`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · conflict · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.sovereign.tears]] ~ an unknown group; the preview names every group`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`conflict` params=`cure/[[sense.holder.reads]] ~ a live holder blocks the tear; read the holders, or --drain`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ a target failed to remove; the culprits ride the hint`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ preview · torn

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`preview` params=`exit/0 fields/[[mode groups selected targets totalBytes liveProcesses]] ~ what a confirm would remove`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`torn` params=`exit/0 ~ the targets removed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

